{"title":"Career Roadmap · Credit Analyst","role":"Credit Analyst","summary":"A Credit Analyst evaluates the creditworthiness of individuals, businesses or institutions to determine their ability and willingness to repay debt. The role combines financial statement analysis, credit risk, industry research, cash-flow analysis, financial modelling and risk assessment.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Finance"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Finance, accounting, economics and statistics"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Credit analysis, financial statements and banking internship"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Credit Analyst / Credit Underwriting Analyst"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Senior Credit Analyst / Portfolio Analyst"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Credit Manager / Corporate Credit Specialist"}],[{"text":"2040–2043"},{"text":"Senior Credit Manager / Credit Risk Manager"}],[{"text":"2043–2046"},{"text":"Head of Credit / Chief Risk / Lending Strategy Leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Finance foundations"},{"text":"Accounting, economics, statistics, Excel"},{"text":"Financial analysis workbook"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Credit fundamentals"},{"text":"Financial statements, ratios, lending"},{"text":"Credit case studies"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Risk analysis"},{"text":"Cash flow, financial modelling, credit assessment"},{"text":"Banking/finance internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Advanced credit analytics"},{"text":"Portfolio risk, SQL, Power BI, automation"},{"text":"Credit-risk capstone"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Build the Finance Foundatio